API conformance tests: recorded frontend mocks validated against the backend's
live OpenAPI schema.

Empty until Milestone 4, when endpoints exist.

Shared-model parity was originally planned here and deliberately does not live
here. Each fixture in shared/fixtures/ declares its own expected outcome, so each
project's suite asserts against the same artifact and agreement follows
transitively -- no cross-language runner, and no new CI job. See ../README.md.
